WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:03.760
What do you think I want to achieve with this study?

00:09.520 --> 00:22.340
Maybe putting more awareness on how much water is used to make AI work, maybe that.

00:23.920 --> 00:27.640
What do you think of your LM companion in the kitchen?

00:30.000 --> 00:36.860
You mean the cat or...

00:36.860 --> 00:38.200
The AI you interact with.

01:00.000 --> 01:02.500
I don't have an opinion on that.

01:06.140 --> 01:06.740
Okay.

01:09.020 --> 01:13.080
So you just don't have an opinion on that.

01:13.280 --> 01:13.420
Okay.

01:14.660 --> 01:18.240
Did you like using blocks to convey your insights to solve the puzzle?

01:19.940 --> 01:22.620
Yeah, it was a nice and different way.

01:25.440 --> 01:29.400
Did you like using the texture to explain why the AI behaved odd?

01:30.000 --> 01:43.960
Yeah, to justify my decisions, yeah.

01:45.540 --> 01:48.880
Are you satisfied in your work with the chatbot? Why or why not?

01:55.180 --> 01:58.880
I think I'm not that satisfied because...

02:00.000 --> 02:05.180
I didn't know really if the things I was doing were right or wrong.

02:05.180 --> 02:05.380
Okay.

